  "description": {
   "value": "<p><strong>Cost:</strong> 250eb (Expensive) <strong>♦</strong> <strong>Required Slots:</strong> 0</p>\n<p><strong>Fits:</strong> All Assault Rifles, Crossbows, and Sniper Rifles</p>\n<p><em>A bulky stock well suited for patient shooters that don’t believe in luck.</em></p>\n<p>Attaching this attachment requires a DV17 Weaponstech Skill Check. Only one Precision Stock may be installed. Drawing the weapon now requires an Action, even while it is easily accessible. While the user is Prone or the weapon is Mounted on a Bipod, if they fire the weapon in Single Shot and roll a 2 on their Attack Check, they gain a +1 bonus to their Check. If they instead roll a 1 on their Attack Check, they instead get a +2 bonus. Incompatible with Buffer Stock, Constant Recoil System, and Folding Structure.</p>\n<p><strong>Attachment slots:</strong> 0</p>\n<p><em>From <a href=\"https://docs.google.com/document/d/13EnSAoiLDsC7zmL-Jr1RqIh_EnuVuFnExqiipDVquMk/edit\">Corgo's 77 Collection V3</a> by Corgopolis (Weapons &gt; Attachment Catalog &gt; Stabilizers &amp; Stocks).</em></p>"
